<title>MEXICO: Mexico world's seventh top tourist spot - ministry.</title>
<headline>Mexico world's seventh top tourist spot - ministry.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico was the world's seventh most popular tourist spot in 1996, the Tourism Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>About 22 million tourists visited Mexico during the year, bringing about $7 billion in revenue for the country's tourism industry, the ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>In 1995, about 20 million tourists visited Mexico, making it the eighth most visited country in the world, it added.</p>
<p>France, the United States, Spain, Italy, China and Britain were the most popular destinations last year, the ministry said.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9565</p>
